Установите Python командой:
Ubuntu/Debian: sudo apt install python3 python3-tk
Fedora: sudo apt install python3 python3-tkinter
Arch: sudo pacman -S python tk
openSUSE: sudo zypper install python3 python3-tk

Установите tkinter (если нет):
Ubuntu/Debian: sudo apt install python3-tk
Fedora: sudo apt install python3-tkinter
Arch: sudo pacman -S tk
openSUSE: sudo zypper install python3-tk

